      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a decent start, but it's a bit too general for what we need for the feature article. I need more specific detail on how these specific brands are actually implementing these shifts. \n\nFor example, can you go deeper into the specific aesthetic directions for the brands in my list? How are they specifically handling the shift toward these structured silhouettes or the new fabric textures? I need this to feel really \"industry-expert\" level. \n\nAgain, just a heads up: the SEO score is going to flag if it's just a list of brands, so make sure the mentions feel integrated into the actual trends you're discussing. I want to see how the brands are driving the change.",
